; THE DRIFTER (2026-07-23, THE HOLLOW BELOW): what is left of a miner who
; never stopped moving — it just floats now, bobbing in the flood, flinging
; glowing water at anything that comes close. Reuses the Slinger's
; silhouette with the Gnat's hover kit (can_fly): a full-body floater rather
; than a flyer, cheap because both are already plain data on EnemyStats.

